infographic compare-binary-horizontal-underline-text-vs
data
  title One group, two failure policies — choose per fan-out
  desc First-error-wins is the silent default; pick all-or-nothing or best-effort on purpose
  compares
    - label All-or-nothing
      children
        - label errgroup.WithContext
          desc First failing callback cancels every sibling via ctx
        - label First error wins
          desc Stored behind a sync.Once; every later error is discarded
        - label One error returned
          desc Wrap with fmt.Errorf so the survivor names its source
        - label Mandatory fan-out
          desc Assemble a page from three required calls
    - label Best-effort
      children
        - label Group without WithContext
          desc Nothing cancels the siblings; all run to completion
        - label Never return errors
          desc Record per-slot into an indexed slice — disjoint, no mutex
        - label errors.Join after Wait
          desc Surfaces every failure; nil only if all parts succeed
        - label Enrichment fan-out
          desc Keep 49 of 50 when one optional call fails
theme
  palette #6366f1 #14b8a6
